<article class="env-lemma" id="055R">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/055R">Lemma <span data-tag="055R">37.29.6</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to Y$, $s : Y \to X$ be as in Situation <a href="/tag/055L" data-tag="055L">37.29.1</a>. Assume </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$f$ is of finite presentation and flat, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
all fibres of $f$ are geometrically reduced. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
  <p> Then $X^0$ is open in $X$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is an immediate consequence of Lemma <a href="/tag/055Q" data-tag="055Q">37.29.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>